{
  "id": null,
  "title": "MLX Opik Tracing",
  "tags": [
    "cluster",
    "mlx",
    "opik",
    "tracing"
  ],
  "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "device",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": "VictoriaMetrics",
        "query": "label_values(mlx_token_confidence_mean, device)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Opik Traces",
      "content": "# Opik Tracing\n\nOpik traces are stored in the self-hosted Opik database (Postgres + ClickHouse), not in VictoriaMetrics.\n\nView traces in the Opik UI at:\n`http://<CENTRAL_IP>:<OPIK_PORT>`\n\nThe proxy exports each chat completion as an Opik trace with:\n- LLM span (input/output/usage/metadata)\n- Hallucination quality feedback scores\n- Token confidence feedback scores\n- OpenInference attributes (via OTLP endpoint)\n\nUse the dashboards below to correlate Opik quality signals with VM metrics.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "graph",
      "title": "Token Confidence (proxy-scored, correlates with Opik traces)",
      "datasource": "VictoriaMetrics",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "mlx_token_confidence_mean{device=~\"$device\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}} mean",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "mlx_token_confidence_min{device=~\"$device\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}} min",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 2,
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "\ud83c\udfaf Drilldown: MLX Quality & Confidence Metrics",
              "url": "/d/mlx-quality?var-device=${__field.labels.device}",
              "targetBlank": false
            },
            {
              "title": "\u26a1 Drilldown: MLX Inference Metrics",
              "url": "/d/mlx-inference?var-device=${__field.labels.device}",
              "targetBlank": false
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "graph",
      "title": "Hallucination Risk (proxy-scored)",
      "datasource": "VictoriaMetrics",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "mlx_hallucination_risk{device=~\"$device\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 2,
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "\ud83c\udfaf Drilldown: MLX Quality & Confidence Metrics",
              "url": "/d/mlx-quality?var-device=${__field.labels.device}",
              "targetBlank": false
            },
            {
              "title": "\u26a1 Drilldown: MLX Inference Metrics",
              "url": "/d/mlx-inference?var-device=${__field.labels.device}",
              "targetBlank": false
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "graph",
      "title": "Output Perplexity",
      "datasource": "VictoriaMetrics",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(mlx_output_perplexity_histogram_bucket{device=~\"$device\"}[5m])) by (le, device))",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}} p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "mlx_output_perplexity{device=~\"$device\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}} latest",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "\ud83c\udfaf Drilldown: MLX Quality & Confidence Metrics",
              "url": "/d/mlx-quality?var-device=${__field.labels.device}",
              "targetBlank": false
            },
            {
              "title": "\u26a1 Drilldown: MLX Inference Metrics",
              "url": "/d/mlx-inference?var-device=${__field.labels.device}",
              "targetBlank": false
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "graph",
      "title": "Scored Completions Coverage",
      "datasource": "VictoriaMetrics",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(mlx_confidence_scored_total{device=~\"$device\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}} {{source}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "uid": "mlx-opik",
